      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: Thanks for the detailed response, was appreciated to hear more detail about how IK systems work in the back end.\nI would agree with Knah that I would prefer more bend in the spine/ chest joint than in the neck. Further, as you said yourself, this option is clearly intended for enthusiasts so giving said users an option to choose what they'd prefer gets bent the most would be ideal. \nI feel like this would be especially true in open beta, so other beta testers can see what options are available and come to their own conclusions on which one they prefer.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
