      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It looks like you can alleviate some of the broken neck symptoms by calibrating with the hmd slightly tilted upwards, and then tilt it back down again, it appears to lengthen the neck enough in a way that prevents it from happening. I have confirmed with at least two others that this workaround is successful for them.\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/983154004504748032/fbt_neck_workaround.mp4\nI had no success in fixing this issue by changing the position and length of either the neck or head bone roots, nor with the avatar descriptor.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "649de4566fc1a60910689b91",
      "author": {
        "_id": "6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486",
        "alias": "Razzmatazz Eagle",
        "aliasID": "65c2b7efed6eefce4c4dceae",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/f9b909781ec10a9c42837d9eafdd9561.png",
        "created": "2021-10-09T14:24:26.758Z",
        "name": "Kung",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "boardID": "621946996d11764c11ffcf01",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2023-06-29T20:06:46.718Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "649de4566fc1a60910689b91",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When using \"lock both\", bending the body IRL over bends the neck in-game, whereas the chest, spine and hip don't bend as much.\nIn other words, the neck is affected too much by the bending compared to the chest, spine and hip.\nPotential ideas:\n- Change the \"weight\" of the neck, making it be less affected by bending.\n- Since the hip tracker is not glued to the person's hip (moreso rotating because of skin bending when the person sits down), I suggest making the hip tracker's rotation value \"more lenient\", sacrificing a bit of rotation accuracy to make the full-body look better.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1260] Neck bends too much when spine bends",
